{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_COMSTACK_SECTION_4_3_1_18_Meta_data_for_application","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_RTE","page":348,"text":"4.3.1.18 Meta data for application\n[SWS_Rte_03620]\nUpstream requirements: SRS_Rte_00322\n⌈The RTE shall forward meta data of a data element to/from COM the application if a\ndata element\n• is used for inter-ECU communication\n• and it is referenced by a MetaDataItemSet of its SenderReceiverInter-\nface\n⌋\nNote: If the data element data is buffered by the Rte, then the meta data must be\nbuffered as well.\nThe Software Component Template Specification [2] describes the modeling of meta\ndata in the context of a SenderReceiverInterface. The specification of AUTOSAR COM\n[3] describes the extended COM APIs while for Large Data Path in COM the already\nexisting SduMetaDataPtr struct member of PduInfoType shall be used.\n[SWS_Rte_03621]\nUpstream requirements: SRS_Rte_00322\n⌈The RTE shall provide access to single meta data items if a data element is referenced\nby a MetaDataItemSet of its SenderReceiverInterface⌋","caption":"4.3.1.18 Meta data for application","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_COMSTACK_SECTION_4_3_1_18_Meta_data_for_application","releases":["R23-11"],"page":318,"hash":"0d5cbb61bd6b62f5","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_COMSTACK_SECTION_4_3_1_18_Meta_data_for_application","releases":["R24-11"],"page":356,"hash":"e49c240c1fb2bd78","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_COMSTACK_SECTION_4_3_1_18_Meta_data_for_application","releases":["R25-11"],"page":348,"hash":"7b6543e422bbefb7","caption":""}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Rte_03620] im Text von SWS_RTE.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_Rte_03620"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Rte_03621] im Text von SWS_RTE.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_Rte_03621"},{"role":"heuristic","co